    class Item3
    {
        dataType="Comment";
        class PositionInfo {position[]={0,0,-5};};
        title="Enable Waldo_SupplyTransfers_Enable and Waldo_PhysicalCargo_Enable in MissionConfig/logisticsConfig.sqf. The two crates and NATO Prowler/DAGOR share one transfer/merge system. The buggy Init also contains measured seat points for this exact vanilla class; do not copy those coordinates to another vehicle. Carry a crate with ACE to try visible mounting. Keep vehicle simulation and collision on. Wikis: https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Supply-Transfers and https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Physical-Cargo";
        id=4;
    };
